* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
*
** RCHKPH
** CHECK IF A PHYSICAL PRINTER DEFINITION EXISTS
*** Author :Michel
***********************************************************************
DEFINE DATA
PARAMETER
1 #PRINTER-ID(A8)
1 #EXIST(L)
1 #LOCATION(A30)
LOCAL
1 PHYSICAL-PRINTERS VIEW OF NRM-PHYSICAL-PRINTERS
  2 PH-VTAMID
  2 PH-LOCATION
*
END-DEFINE
FIND-NUM.
FIND  PHYSICAL-PRINTERS WITH PH-VTAMID = #PRINTER-ID
  MOVE PH-LOCATION TO #LOCATION
END-FIND
IF *NUMBER(FIND-NUM.) > 0 MOVE TRUE TO #EXIST
ELSE
 MOVE FALSE TO #EXIST
END-IF
END
